    "sourcePath": "D:\\dev\\vs2022\\cpp\\projects\\staticForge\\doc\\staticForge\\DocForge Test Project.dfproj",
    "sourceKind": "file",
    "tabs": [
      {
        "id": "tab_mwrxgxne1jx0npu1vls05n",
        "name": "Markdown",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "node_mwrxgxne1qd28461yt2s40",
            "name": "Text & Headings",
            "content": "# Heading 1\n\nParagraph directly below h1. **Bold**, *italic*, _italic underscore_, ***bold italic*** and `inline code`.\n\n## Heading 2\n\nA second paragraph with an [external link](https://example.com) and a long line that should wrap: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.\n\n### Heading 3\n\n#### Heading 4\n\n##### Heading 5 (not supported, stays text)  [x]\n\n> A single blockquote line.\n\n> First quote line.  [x]\n> Second quote line with **bold** and `  [x] code`.  [x]\n\n\ndasdas [x] das\n- dasd [x] dasd\n- [x] dasd\n---\n\ndada\n\n| Column  [x]1 | Column 2 | Column 3 |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n|  [x] | Value    | Value    |\n\n\n\n## Comments\n\nText before a comment line.\n<!-- this comment line must not render -->\nText after a comment line.\n\n<!--\nA multi-line comment\nthat must not render.\n-->\n\nParagraph after a multi-line comment. Inline <!-- hidden --> comment inside a sentence.\n\nComment inside inline code stays text: `<!-- visible -->`.\n\nUnclosed comment stays text: <!-- never closed\n\n## Unsupported syntax (must stay text)\n\n~~strikethrough~~\n\n![image](https://example.com/image.png)\n\n<b>raw html</b> and <div>block html</div>\n\n- [ ] task list item\n\nFootnote[^1]\n\nSetext heading\n==============\n",
            "type": "page",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "node_mwrxgxne1yrf3ldzw4b0g",
            "name": "Lists",
            "content": "# Lists\n\n## Unordered\n\n- Item with dash\n- Item with **bold**\n  - Nested with 2 spaces\n    - Nested with 4 spaces\n      - Third level\n- Back to root\n\n* Item with star\n* Second star item\n\n## Ordered\n\n1. First\n2. Second\n3. Third\n   1. Nested ordered\n   2. Nested ordered\n\n## Mixed\n\n1. Ordered root\n  - Unordered child\n  - Unordered child\n2. Ordered root again\n\n## Spacing\n\n- Item before a paragraph\n\nParagraph between two lists.\n\n- Item after a paragraph\n",
            "type": "page",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "node_mwrxgxne1dc17zf1mh9922",
            "name": "Tables",
            "content": "# Tables\n\n## Basic\n\n| Name | Value | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| a    | 1     | first |\n| b    | 2     | **bold** and `code` |\n\n## Separator alignment\n\n| Left | Center | Right |\n|:-----|:------:|------:|\n| l    | c      | r     |\n| left | center | right |\n\n## All properties\n\n{\n  hover=cell,row,col; striped\n}\n| Row | Col 1 (hl, 120px) | Col 2 | Col 3 (20%) |\n|-----|-------------------|-------|-------------|\n| 1   | a                 | b     | c           |\n| 2   | hl row            | hl row| hl row      |\n| 3   | d                 | hl cell, right | e  |\n| 4   | f                 | g     | h           |\n\n## Hover variants\n\n{hover}\n| hover = cell | b |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 2 |\n\n{hover=row}\n| hover = row | b |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 2 |\n\n{hover=cell,row,col}\n| hover = col | b |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 2 |\n\n## Properties inside a comment\n\n{hover=cell,row,col}\n| Striped | via comment |\n|---------|-------------|\n| 1       | a           |\n| 2       | b           |\n| 3       | c           |\n\n## Invalid values (ignored)\n\n{line=12; col 0: width=abc align=diagonal; row 99: hl}\n| line=12 clamped/ignored | b |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 2 |\n\n## Not property syntax (stays text)\n\n{ \"json\": 1 }\n| a | b |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 2 |\n\n## Property block without element (removed)\n\n{striped}\n\nParagraph after the dangling property block.\n\n## Long table (sticky header)\n\n{striped; hover=row}\n| # | Name | Description |\n|---|------|-------------|\n| 1 | Row 1 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 2 | Row 2 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 3 | Row 3 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 4 | Row 4 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 5 | Row 5 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 6 | Row 6 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 7 | Row 7 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 8 | Row 8 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 9 | Row 9 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 10 | Row 10 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 11 | Row 11 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 12 | Row 12 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 13 | Row 13 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 14 | Row 14 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 15 | Row 15 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 16 | Row 16 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 17 | Row 17 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 18 | Row 18 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 19 | Row 19 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 20 | Row 20 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 21 | Row 21 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 22 | Row 22 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 23 | Row 23 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 24 | Row 24 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 25 | Row 25 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 26 | Row 26 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 27 | Row 27 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 28 | Row 28 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 29 | Row 29 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 30 | Row 30 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 31 | Row 31 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 32 | Row 32 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 33 | Row 33 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 34 | Row 34 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 35 | Row 35 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 36 | Row 36 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 37 | Row 37 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 38 | Row 38 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 39 | Row 39 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n| 40 | Row 40 | Scroll down, the header should stay visible |\n",
            "type": "page",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "node_mwrxgxnelo9zvv1nfy03p",
            "name": "Code",
            "content": "# Code\n\n## Languages\n\n```js\n// JavaScript\nconst answer = 42;\nfunction greet(name) {\n  return `Hello ${name}`;\n}\n```\n\n```cpp\n#include <mutex>\nstd::mutex m;\nint main() { std::lock_guard<std::mutex> lock(m); return 0; }\n```\n\n```python\ndef greet(name: str) -> str:\n    return f\"Hello {name}\"\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"name\": \"DocForge\", \"version\": 1, \"enabled\": true }\n```\n\n```test\n// TestLang (dev-only built-in language)\nlet value = 1;\n```\n\n## Diff\n\n```diff\nunchanged line\n-removed line\n+added line\nunchanged line\n```\n\n```diff:js\nconst a = 1;\n-const b = 2;\n+const b = 3;\n+const c = 4;\n```\n\n## Unknown and missing tags\n\n```notalanguage\nUnknown tag, no highlighting.\n```\n\n```\nNo tag at all.\n```\n\n## Nested fence (4 backticks)\n\n````md\n```js\nconst nested = true;\n```\n````\n\n## Long line (horizontal scroll)\n\n```js\nconst longLine = 'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua';\n```\n\n## Code properties\n\n{copy}\n```js\n// copy button\nconst copy = true;\n```\n\n{numbers}\n```js\n// line numbers\nconst a = 1;\nconst b = 2;\nconst c = 3;\n```\n\n{label=\"Custom Label\"}\n```js\nconst label = 'custom';\n```\n\n{label=none}\n```js\nconst label = 'none';\n```\n\n{indent=2}\n```cpp\n// indent guides, 2 spaces per level\n{\n  {\n    int i;\n\n    int j;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n{indent=tab; numbers}\n```js\n// indent guides, tabs\nfunction run() {\n\tif (true) {\n\t\treturn 1;\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n{\n  copy\n  numbers\n  label=\"All Properties\"\n}\n```diff:js\nconst a = 1;\n-const b = 2;\n+const b = 3;\nconst c = 4;\n```\n\n<!-- {copy; numbers} -->\n```python\n# properties inside a comment\nprint(\"hello\")\n```\n\n## Inline code\n\nPlain `inline code`, highlighted {lang=cpp}`std::vector<int> v;`, {lang=js}`const x = 1;`, unknown {lang=nope}`still code`.\n\nInvalid property in front stays text: { nope }`code`.\n\nComment-like text in code: `<!-- not a comment -->`.\n",
            "type": "page",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "id": "node_mwrxgxne171hsou1y0nifu",
            "name": "Sections",
            "content": "# Sections\n\n[toc]\n\n::: Collapsed section with **bold** title\nText inside a section.\n\n- list item\n- list item\n\n| a | b |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 2 |\n:::\n\n{open}\n::: Open section\n```js\n// ::: inside code is no section\nconst x = 1;\n```\n\n::: Nested section\n## Heading inside a nested section\nLinked from the [toc] above (a click opens the sections around it).\n:::\n:::\n\n:: not a section (two colons) and a stray close below stays text\n\n:::\n\n::: Unclosed section ends with the entry\nLast text.\n",
            "type": "page",
            "children": []
          }
        ]
